reads    Get: reads a page, and changes nothing
reads    Head: the same as Get, but the answer has no body
reads    Options: asks what a page supports
reads    Trace: sends the request back, for working out what a proxy did to it
changes  Post: sends something new, such as a filled-in form
changes  Put: replaces what is there with what you send
changes  Patch: changes part of what is there
changes  Delete: removes it
